            "review_title": "Review at Popeyes Louisiana Kitchen",
            "review_text": "NeilD223\nMelbourne, Australia145 contributions\n0\nSpicy chicken in transit\nApr 2023 • Couples\nwe have a tradition. When we fly into Vietnam and we are transiting to Hanoi, we get Popeyes Louisiana Chicken and then have a 333 beer. have done it just about every time we go to Vietnam. The shop is on the secure side of the domestic terminal in HCM right at the end of the gate area. Chicken is great. Lots of spice, really crunchy and cheap. Staff are always nice. followed up with a 333 beer.\nRead more\nWritten April 29, 2023",
            "rating": 5.0,
