            "review_title": "Review at Popeyes Louisiana Kitchen",
            "review_text": "surprisealot w\nSydney, Australia131 contributions\n0\nA good link in a chain, many toppings for fries and extra chilli and spice if you like\nApr 2016 • Family\nWe found our first Popeye outlet at HCMC airport before 8am. Not having an outlet near our town we decided to try for an unusual breakfast before our flight. Good selection of mainly chicken dishes. But it was the fries that have left a lasting memory, even at that hour. This is a fast food and chain outlet, yet staff were friendly and attentive. \n\nWe have tried and may try again if we discover another outlet. not bad.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 29, 2016",
